   "source": [
    "# Day 5 — Rolling 90-day Sharpe (returns over time) for top 5 key funds\n",
    "\n",
    "Rolling Sharpe (per user definition):\n",
    "\n",
    "Sharpe_90d(t) = (rolling_mean(excess_return) / rolling_std(excess_return)) * sqrt(252)\n",
    "\n",
    "Using excess returns with Rf = 6.5% annual converted to daily as proxy: excess_return = daily_return - (0.065/252)."
   ]
  },
